        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Activities",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.figment.io/ethereum/activities",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "network",
                "value": "hoodi",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "type",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by activity type."
              },
              {
                "name": "status",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by activity-life status."
              },
              {
                "name": "address",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter to activities for a wallet address (case-insensitive). For Ethereum this is the validator withdrawal address. Matches the `delegation_address` returned on each activity."
              },
              {
                "name": "start",
                "value": "2024-03-12T00:00:00Z",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "end",
                "value": "2024-03-13T00:00:00Z",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns Ethereum staking activities for the authenticated organization.\n\n## Activity types\n\n| `type`          | Description | Notes |\n|-----------------|-------------|-------|\n| `stake`         | ETH deposited to the deposit contract to provision a validator | |\n| `unstake`       | Validator exit initiated | `tx.hash` and `tx.status` are always `null` — the exit is an off-chain beacon chain message, not an on-chain transaction |\n| `delegation`    | Rewards compounded / top-up stake activated | |"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Activity",
